00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:42.460
And that continues to grow.

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:46.080
So you need to have an
infrastructure which

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:49.780
scales linearly as you
grow your business.

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:53.220
You don't need to
re-architect your architecture

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:56.550
or your infrastructure every
three months, every six months.

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.610
So you need that level
of infrastructure, which

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:01.380
just scales automatically.

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:04.510
The second one being
finding the right talent.

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:07.260
So the way the
technology has evolved,

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:08.940
if you see the open
source technology

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:12.270
the way it was 10 years
back, the way it is now,

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:14.300
there has been an
exponential growth

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.080
in the set of technologies.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:19.980
