every three months you

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.700
see something new coming up.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:30.750
So that also is one of the
biggest challenges which most

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.730
of the enterprises are facing.

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:34.420
