reporting on top of it.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.300
Bigtable-- if you have to do a
lot of time series analytics,

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.610
Bigtable is very good at that.

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:21.490
In fact, you will see one
of the most exciting use

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:24.560
